intel-vca2-host (2.3.26+ubuntu24.04.8) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix Linux >= 6.14 device_find_child() callback constification.
  * Stop setting BLK_MQ_F_SHOULD_MERGE on Linux >= 6.14, where it was
    removed because request merging is enabled by default.
  * Retain the Linux 6.8 through 6.13 callback and block-layer paths.

